{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201130","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1620113001:1":{"text":"ここの最近の悪徳商人たちときたら、本当に頭に来ちゃう！不味い肉ならまだしも、ここまでひどい肉は初めて！","source_cn":"最近那些无良摊贩真是越来越嚣张了！我买过难吃的肉、坏掉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF54BB0D314138108","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620113002:1":{"text":"新鮮なのは見た目だけで、煮込んでみたら、香りどころか何の味もしないんだから！","source_cn":"看上去是鲜肉，切下来纹理也好。结果买回家一炖，别说肉香...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944BD64A3DAE91B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620113003:1":{"text":"俺が買った魚の缶詰も同じだ！ほら、濃厚・芳醇とかいう高級な方を選んだのに……","source_cn":"我买的鱼罐头也是！你看，我买的还是加浓加香版本！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE626AEE2E1EF5374","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620113004:1":{"text":"家で開けて食べてみたら、まるで紙でも食ってるのかと思ったよ！","source_cn":"结果昨天到家拆开一吃——呸！我还以为自己在嚼白纸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x519D4A582F7897C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620113005:1":{"text":"見た目はちゃんとしてるのに、食べるとまるで味がしない……","source_cn":"这两个人抱怨说，买来的鲜肉和鱼罐头虽然看着好好的，吃起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x352A091C206D0601","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_t